<title>INDIA: INDIA'S PUNJAB - Final results in state assembly polls.</title>
<headline>INDIA'S PUNJAB - Final results in state assembly polls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the final results of elections to the 117-seat state assembly in the northern Indian state of Punjab, declared on Monday.</p>
<p>Punjab went to the polls on Friday and vote counting began on Sunday morning.</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Party							  Total</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Akali Dal (Badal)					    74</p>
<p> Bharatiya Janata Party (BJP)			     18</p>
<p> Congress party						 14</p>
<p> Communist Party of India				    2</p>
<p> Bahujan Samaj party					   1</p>
<p> Others							    8</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Total seats declared					117</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------</p>
